# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build artifacts.
#
# paper/generated/ and paper/figures/ are deliberately NOT ignored. They are
# built from runs/, which is CC-BY-NC and can never be committed, so a clone
# could not rebuild them: they are the only durable record of the results and
# the only reason `latexmk` works on a fresh checkout. paper.pdf is committed
# for the same reason. Aggregate numbers in a paper are publishable; the
# dataset they came from is not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.bcf
paper/*.blg
paper/*.brf
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.lof
paper/*.log
paper/*.lot
paper/*.nav
paper/*.out
paper/*.run.xml
paper/*.snm
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.toc
paper/*.vrb

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
